{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Xpy0hGwLYl1793278808.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>瑞士室內網球賽，祖高域反勝對手入次圈。</p><p></p><p>面對黑衫的坎拔，祖高域首盤失一個發球局，先輸4-6。</p><p></p><p>第二盤開局救回「破發分」，並在第二局成功「破發」，以6-3追平，令坎拔連續兩圈都打足三盤，排名12對38，他的「一發」得分率七成一，不及對手，主動得分19對39次，不過犯錯亦較少。</p><p></p><p>自2011年再參加這項賽事，祖高域第三盤再一次「破發」，贏多盤6-4，兩次交手也勝出，晉級16強對德國舒路夫。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:41:30.468416+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:22.597559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:26.358505+00:00","content_hash":"0e2fc2d3ff11461f8237f3cf60760889b488cc886690d15234f03e9f225a8cd6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:41:30.468416+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}